{
  "name": "Webhook 範例 1：GET 請求與瀏覽器即時問候",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔗 範例 1：GET 請求與瀏覽器即時問候\n\n1. **Webhook**：GET，Path `hello`\n2. **整理問候資料**：從 `$json.query` 取得 `name`、`format`\n3. **要回傳網頁嗎？**\n   - `?format=html` ➔ 回傳 HTML 問候卡片（瀏覽器顯示成網頁）\n   - 其他 ➔ 回傳 JSON\n\n試試看：\n- `/webhook/hello?name=小明`\n- `/webhook/hello?name=小明&format=html`",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "7e98cb21-a3d5-50f9-b93a-c9910b93e58e",
      "name": "流程說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "path": "hello",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4e3361ab-f5e1-5b44-b36b-6c808a2e9b53",
      "name": "接收 GET Webhook 請求",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -220,
        420
      ],
      "webhookId": "2538b8d0-79e2-5fbe-b979-047c33d0ed1c"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "dac64005-ec60-579f-b7e3-3f9ab8964a7c",
              "name": "userName",
              "value": "={{ $json.query.name || '親愛的朋友' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "234038a1-3993-5d50-b004-4f641397196c",
              "name": "safeName",
              "value": "={{ String($json.query.name || '親愛的朋友').replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'})[c]) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "3acb85fd-6dcd-5527-9f8b-b59d252cc740",
              "name": "welcomeMessage",
              "value": "=👋 哈囉 {{ $json.query.name || '親愛的朋友' }}！恭喜您成功觸發第一個 n8n Webhook！",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "7dffa30b-ca32-5502-b3e3-8c871af4d74f",
              "name": "serverTime",
              "value": "={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f16ca35f-22be-507d-aacd-6e594c66e4e1",
              "name": "clientIp",
              "value": "={{ ($json.headers['x-forwarded-for'] || '').split(',')[0] || $json.headers.host }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2f517260-c3aa-50c0-ac0f-8677bca22dec",
              "name": "format",
              "value": "={{ String($json.query.format || 'json').toLowerCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "38a0ce11-e2a6-5d59-a220-68a337e336d1",
      "name": "整理問候資料",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        20,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d3ad84f6-5a87-5841-869c-cd41f1a0f71f",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.format }}",
              "rightValue": "html",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "246182a5-1e9c-549f-a6f7-7fdfb6ca1b60",
      "name": "要回傳網頁嗎？",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "=<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>哈囉！</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Microsoft JhengHei',Arial,sans-serif;background:#f1f5f9;color:#0f172a;padding:20px}.card{background:#fff;max-width:560px;margin:24px auto;padding:28px;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.08)}h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px}.muted{color:#64748b}label{display:block;margin-top:16px;font-weight:600}input,textarea,button{width:100%;font-size:17px;padding:12px;margin-top:6px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:12px;font-family:inherit}button{background:#4f46e5;color:#fff;border:0;margin-top:22px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.big{font-size:56px;text-align:center;margin:8px 0}</style></head><body><main class=\"card\" style=\"text-align:center\"><div class=\"big\">👋</div><h1>哈囉，{{ $json.safeName }}！</h1><p class=\"muted\">這個網頁是 n8n 工作流產生的 🎉</p><p style=\"background:#eef2ff;border-radius:12px;padding:14px\">伺服器時間：{{ $json.serverTime }}</p><p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">把網址的 <b>name=</b> 改成別的名字，重新整理看看！</p></main></body></html>",
        "options": {
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "3c01b1f1-83ec-5d31-a69e-b1a6ed24362c",
      "name": "回傳 HTML 問候卡片",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        520,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ status: 'success', message: $json.welcomeMessage, visitor: $json.userName, server_time: $json.serverTime, client_ip: $json.clientIp, tip: '🎉 在網址加上 &format=html，改看網頁版！' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "8c69ec23-4be6-5d2d-a717-ccc29aea2e87",
      "name": "回傳 JSON 結果",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        520,
        520
      ]
    }
  ],
